              "directions": "Fast travel back to Dino Peaks Mini Golf so you are standing back at the spawn-in location. Face south, turn right, and then follow the road for a while — past Pebbles the Cat Museum, past the bus, and over the bridge. Slow down once you are past the bridge and walk slowly while looking to the right. The phantom's corpse is lying in front of the Strouds Run State Park sign on your right.",
              "image_bottom": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Slasher-Mask-Locations/burning-springs-dino-peaks-mini-golf-4-item.avif"
