              "image_top": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Slasher-Mask-Locations/skyline-valley-rapidan-camp-1-map.avif",
              "directions": "From the spawn-in location, face east and run forward — either jumping over the fences or running around the long way — until you are at the bottom of the ramp. Face east again and you will see a building on your right. Jump over the hedge and continue walking forward, go up the stairs, take a few steps forward, and enter the building via the door on your right. Stop in the doorway and look right; you will see the phantom's corpse on the ground on your right.",
              "image_bottom": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Slasher-Mask-Locations/skyline-valley-rapidan-camp-1-item.avif"
            },
            {
              "label": "Spawn 2",
              "image_top": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Slasher-Mask-Locations/skyline-valley-rapidan-camp-2-map.avif",
              "directions": "Turn around and exit the building. Turn right and follow the deck to the very end. Turn left so you are facing the water. Walk straight, jump over the railing and the walls, and keep walking straight until you are standing next to the gazebo on the edge of the water. The phantom's corpse will spawn inside.",
              "image_bottom": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Slasher-Mask-Locations/skyline-valley-rapidan-camp-2-item.avif"
            },
            {
              "label": "Spawn 3",
              "image_top": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Slasher-Mask-Locations/skyline-valley-rapidan-camp-3-map.avif",
              "directions": "Stand inside the gazebo and face north; you will see a vertibird on top of the hill in front of you. Run, swim, jump, or fly over to the vertibird on the hill. Stop at the orange forklift just before the vertibird and face north. Walk over to the green trailer in front of you and enter via the doorway in the middle. Turn right and follow the trailer to the end, and the phantom's corpse will be on the ground at the end.",
              "image_bottom": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Slasher-Mask-Locations/skyline-valley-rapidan-camp-3-item.avif"
            }
          ],
